    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Import · T-046 · n8n 2.41.6\n1. Create Data Tables in the same project:\n- wa_candados: clave (string), ejecucion (string).\n- wa_ultimo: remitente (string), fecha (ISO UTC string).\n- wa_pendientes: destino (string), texto (string), origen (string).\nDo NOT create id, createdAt, or updatedAt: n8n generates them.\n2. Replace placeholders:\n- CONFIGURE_WA_TRIGGER_CRED_ID: whatsAppTriggerApi credential.\n- CONFIGURE_WA_PHONE_NUMBER_ID: business phone-number ID, not the displayed telephone number.\n- CONFIGURE_WA_CHAT_ID: replace chatId=0 with the authorized cuentas-bot-v7 chat number.\n- CONFIGURE_WA_DIEGO, CONFIGURE_WA_ANGEL, CONFIGURE_WA_ADMIN: authorized m.from values in permitidos.\n- CONFIGURE_WA_CANDADOS_TABLE_ID, CONFIGURE_WA_ULTIMO_TABLE_ID, CONFIGURE_WA_PENDIENTES_TABLE_ID: table IDs.\n- CONFIGURE_ENVIAR_WORKFLOW_ID: cuentas-enviar-v1.\n- CONFIGURE_BOT_V7_WORKFLOW_ID: cuentas-bot-v7.\n- CONFIGURE_ERRORES_WORKFLOW_ID (settings): cuentas-errores-v1.\n3. Review the placeholder Telegram VehicleLedger credential, group, and Graph v25.0.\n4. Import/publish cuentas-enviar-v1 and cuentas-bot-v7 BEFORE this inbound adapter. If v7 replaces an older Telegram bot workflow, unpublish the old workflow BEFORE publishing v7.\n5. cuentas-enviar-v1 accepts {canal,destino,texto,botones} and returns {ok}; only ok:true permits deleting pending items. cuentas-bot-v7 receives {update} only. Set nodes exclude other fields.\n6. Meta test numbers send only to verified recipients. Test authorized/unauthorized text, stickers, audio/photos/PDFs, reactions and unsupported messages (group copy only), contextless or foreign buttons (copy only), long text with &, consecutive messages with queued notices, and a repeated wamid.\nDelivered inactive, without pinned data or secrets. ¿Ya recibido? + insert is not an atomic reservation across simultaneous executions. Pending delivery: rowNotExists → insert pend:<id> → wait 3 s → exclude higher-ID reservations → verify execution → deliver. Only ok:true deletes the original pending ID and retains reservations. If sending returns ok:false, lacks ok:true, or throws, remove all pend:<id> reservations (including losing executions) and retain wa_pendientes for the next message. Releasing no reservations must not stop the workflow. Verify concurrency and failure recovery in n8n before deployment.",
        "height": 650,
        "width": 1100
      },
